\newlabel{tab:renaming}{{31}{25}{Accuracy (\%) under original vs.\ renamed labels on FewRel count-8 batches. Renaming reduced embedding similarity but decreased accuracy in both groups, with a larger drop on high-BCS batches (Cohen's $d = -2.92$) than low-BCS ($d = -1.09$). Interaction: $\Delta _{\text {high}} - \Delta _{\text {low}} = -5.9$\,pp ($t = -7.23$, $p < 0.001$)}{table.caption.85}{}}
